V6.0%EF%BC%89%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%98%E5%B7%A5%E5%9D%8A%E9%99%90%E6%97%B6%E5%85%91%E6%8D%A2%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22%E7%BD%AE%E6%8D%A2%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22background-color%3Argb(251%2C%20253%2C%20255)%5C%22%3E%E7%BD%AE%E6%8D%A2%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%E5%88%B7%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1688357350080\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/72350798/57e18d879b158e87691114122c55d34c_369993812713650098.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">286</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">21</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">特殊的诸神座武器，使用在大海深处中发现的异色魂钢块铸造而成。天命发现这块魂钢时，它正静静地漂流在黑暗而寂静的马里亚纳海沟中，宛如深海的住民。不知是这片死寂孕育了它，还是它造就了这片死寂······</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">深海之怒</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]发动一次突刺攻击，造成50%攻击力物理伤害。如果击中非无敌/霸体状态的敌人，则发动投技攻击，控制敌人并造成共90%+1200.0%攻击力物理伤害；在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%+700.0%攻击力物理伤害，不计入冷却时间；爆发状态下，投技额外造成500.0%攻击力的物理伤害。辉骑士·月魄装备时，触发防御反击时，自身暴击率提高20%，持续3秒</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">覆世骇浪</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色的暴击率提高15.0%，蓄力攻击和投技会标记敌人，攻击被标记的敌人时，暴击伤害提高20.0%。爆发状态下，每2.5秒释放一次冲击，造成60.0%攻击力的物理伤害，该攻击的类型视为必杀技，有50%的额外暴击率，且会标记被击中的敌人。标记持续10秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给、活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅 </td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗大伟哥黑金卡兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第二十期（V5.2）、第二十八期（V6.0）作战工坊限时兑换</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">置换空间（概率刷出）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22